OL,3,GNEWSAArtwork on town's cliff set to be
OL,4,Acompleted
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new art sculpture is being installed
OL,7,Fon Bournemouth's West Cliff.
OL,9,FLean Into the Wind is part of BCP
OL,10,FCouncil's government-funded Coastal
OL,11,FPublic Art and Heritage Trail and
OL,12,Freflects the town's coastline and
OL,13,Fidentity.
OL,15,FIt was developed with input from
OL,16,Fschoolchildren and community groups and
OL,17,Fthe trail aims to encourage visitors to
OL,18,Fexplore the area's heritage.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
