OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAArtwork on town's cliff set to be
OL,4,Acompleted
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Martin, BCP Council's cabinet
OL,7,Fmember for culture, communications and
OL,8,Fcustomer, said: "Installation is now
OL,9,Fcomplete and the remaining temporary
OL,10,Ffencing will begin to be removed next
OL,11,Fweek, with some low-level fencing
OL,12,Fstaying in place for a short time to
OL,13,Fallow newly seeded meadow grass to
OL,14,Festablish."
